[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 13260.63, "timestamp": "03:41:00", "text": "你拿到了这张纸，玩这个游戏。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13262.83, "timestamp": "03:41:02", "text": "类似这样的东西。你可以躲避"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13265.75, "timestamp": "03:41:05", "text": "像子弹一样，很难射击"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13269.19, "timestamp": "03:41:09", "text": "朝这个射击，但这仍然很有用"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13271.59, "timestamp": "03:41:11", "text": "重新定位，我不使用这个功能。我是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13276.03, "timestamp": "03:41:16", "text": "比如，我该怎么做？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13281.469, "timestamp": "03:41:21", "text": "诸如此类的事情。呃，那是什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13289.03, "timestamp": "03:41:29", "text": "呃，我应该已经热身完毕了。我确实玩过。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13291.99, "timestamp": "03:41:31", "text": "在早晨。拉屎。是的，我玩过。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13294.79, "timestamp": "03:41:34", "text": "在早晨。取消。不，不要取消"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13295.87, "timestamp": "03:41:35", "text": "我。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13305.67, "timestamp": "03:41:45", "text": "不，不知道。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13309.63, "timestamp": "03:41:49", "text": "我开始频繁使用烟雾弹。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13313.269, "timestamp": "03:41:53", "text": "实际上。有时候，不，有时候我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13316.67, "timestamp": "03:41:56", "text": "好好打。有时候我玩得很烂。"}]